AssignmentState has mapProcessToClientStateRebalanceDTO to be used during the rebalance

assignActiveStatefulTasks() assigns active tasks to the HAAClientState

balanceTasksOverThreads() optimises this (ok for the active version)

populateNewActiveAssignments() assigns these to the newAssignments

optimiseActiveStatefulTasks() does rack aware balancing on the newAssignments map

--> now mapProcessToClientStateRebalanceDTO is stale

